      "created_at": "2021-06-29T16:48:12.346Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m so jealous of their weather report. Low 70s? I’d kill for low 70s right now. D:</p>\n<p>I do love a good ineffectual troll. Ha ha, guys, a great lie indeed. :’)</p>\n<p>It’s a shame so little is known about these characters, both versions sound just as interesting as any other heroes in the canon.</p>\n<p>I hope everyone recognizes that this argument over needing a single character trait to become an Isoflux-alpha fueled hero is due to Adam arguing comics tropes and Christopher just not catching what he’s laying down. :B</p>\n<p>Gotta say, I’m kinda into letter time.</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
