      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-22T18:31:17.991Z",
      "cooked": "<p>At last my relisten from the beginning, starting in August, has caught up to the first time C&amp;A read one of my letters.  In case this never got confirmed before, America’s Crappiest Legacy was a Justifier creation.  It wasn’t great, but for a first attempt (or at least first success), it certainly got a lot of laughs, even if many were “I hate this so much lol”.</p>\n<p>This comment occurred to me on the preceding Editors Note, but to carry it forward one week: Inversiverse Antimox is just Mox.</p>",
